<div class="help-page"><div class="help-wrap"><div class="help-head"><h1>How can we help?</h1><p>Quick answers for shopping, wishlist, rent and account questions.</p></div><div class="faq"><details open><summary>How do I add a book to my cart?</summary><p>Open a book and choose Add to Cart. Your cart count updates immediately and the cart becomes available from the navbar.</p></details><details><summary>Can I save books without buying?</summary><p>Yes. Tap the heart on a book card and the title will appear in Wishlist.</p></details><details><summary>How does renting work?</summary><p>Open a book, choose Rent Book, set start and end dates, confirm the rental and continue to checkout from your cart.</p></details><details><summary>Why might an image show a BookSpot placeholder?</summary><p>The saved image path could not be found in uploads/assets. The updated helper now shows a clean fallback rather than a broken image icon.</p></details><details><summary>How do I contact support?</summary><p>Use the Contact page. Messages are stored in contact_form_submissions when that table exists, or in messages on older setups.</p></details></div><div class="help-cta"><div><strong>Still need help?</strong><p>Send a message to the BookSpot support team.</p></div><a href="<?= site_url('contact'); ?>">Contact Support</a></div></div></div>